{"code":"049180","name":"셀루메드","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건설","sector_desc":"주택·토목·플랜트 시공. 부동산 경기, 금리, 해외 수주와 원가율이 핵심 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1985년 설립, 2002년 코스닥 상장 후 2010년 코리아본뱅크 합병으로 의료기기 및 바이오시밀러 사업에 진출함. 연결대상 종속회사로 셀루메드바이오로직스, 인스그린, 환경이엔지, 보령엘엔지특화산단 등 5개사를 보유하고 있음. 의료기기 사업에서는 탈회골, 무릎연골 등 조직공학 제품과 인공무릎관절, 동종이식재를 취급하며, 바이오로직스 사업에서는 골형성단백질과 활액대체재를 제조·유통하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":1009.0,"open":1009.0,"high":1009.0,"low":1009.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":41.9128,"ma20":1009.0,"ma60":1009.0,"ma120":1009.0,"ma200":1149.885,"close_vs_ma200":-12.2521,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":12.6546,"r2_250":0.0171,"high52":2975.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":33.916,"dd_52w":-66.084,"mdd_1y":-60.7393,"atr14_pct":78.5714,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":38.9905,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":1.68,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.2,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":16.0,"op_margin_q":5.1948,"op_qoq":200.0,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":137.2093,"rev_yoy":-12.9944,"op_trend_4q":-5.283,"fin_period":"202606","roe":15.85,"debt_ratio":182.95,"per":25.23,"pbr":3.3,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.68,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"049180","name":"셀루메드","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_cod